{"server":"tw","storyId":"act21side_level_act21side_01_end","groupId":"act21side","stageId":"act21side_01","title":"雨落無聲","storyCode":"IS-1","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act21side/level_act21side_01_end.txt","sourceHash":"314bf7ce9be220ac05363e8d7b07b00fedff17035fa5bfd15b1f29afbd062d12","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g4_srctheater"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"你不明白他是什麼樣的人，我瞭解他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是不是太過相信自己有能力“瞭解”一個人了？我們是不是太容易被那些因感情和衝動而激發出的幻光蒙蔽了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"薩爾瓦多雷......他有資格走出哥倫比亞的暗巷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的妹妹，他是個敘拉古人，你不明白他的手段。你以為他真的會幫助我們積累財富？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他只會引火焚身，連帶我們一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"他會用拳頭保護自己，再用秩序約束拳頭，這還不夠嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別說得這麼浪漫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"不，哥哥。別的敘拉古人喜歡視血漬與傷口為勳章。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"唯有他知道，血就是血。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"空，我演得怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"你想聽實話嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想聽想聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"糟透啦！能天使你果然不適合這個！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，我覺得我還挺投入感情的啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"演戲也不光是投入感情就可以啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"不過就對台詞而言，還不錯！起碼幾乎沒有念錯詞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對我要求這麼低嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"可頌，你覺得怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得很棒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是，剛才在表達對哥哥的不滿的時候，是不是情緒應該下壓一點？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，換一種表現方式嗎......那我等一下試試。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇哦，可頌，你什麼時候這麼內行的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要小看每周都去給空探班的人好嗎，我可不像某兩位大忙人一樣整天來無影去無蹤的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，但我可不會不告而別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是那個......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，這是不是也說明了我們一定能找到她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"很有特色的表演。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"欸。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"請問，您是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我叫文索內希俄斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，文什麼來著......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"叫我文就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦！文先生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"請問，文先生，如果沒有什麼事的話，可以請您離開嗎，我還在排練當中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有事，我正在觀賞一場演出，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"我並不認為一個一邊走路一邊吃披薩的人是在觀賞一場演出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"存在觀賞時不能吃披薩的規定嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，劇院有類似的規定吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那也只是劇院對人的規定，不是歌舞劇對人的規定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"規範使人在表面上擁有了對事物相同的敬畏，虛假的高台於是拔地而起，真正的敬畏卻反而難見蹤影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要吃嗎，小姑娘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚哇，口感好差！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟這是街邊最便宜的披薩。但是，醬料的滋味其實很不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"......那麼，您既然旁觀了剛才的演出，對我的表演有何評價？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這其中的重點在於你所擅長的捕捉情感與表達情感的方式與歌舞劇的方式有一些差異。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很顯然習慣於舞台，或者說，你太習慣於舞台了，這反而讓你難以作為一名歌舞劇演員站在舞台上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這很顯然並不怪你，不過，這也是你必須跨過的考驗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，大叔，看不出來你還挺專業的嘛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"思考一下，你，一個哥倫比亞富商的女兒。他，薩爾瓦多雷，來自敘拉古的無業遊民。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他和你見過的所有男人都不一樣，他對你的身份不屑一顧，卻又對你關照連連。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他比所有人都懶惰，卻又比所有人都精明。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他彷彿命中註定要成為一個家族的領袖，走上一條無法回頭的危險道路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴我，小姐，你愛這樣一個人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"我......愛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你恐懼！你越是愛他，就越是怕他！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你沒有任何把握留住他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直覺告訴你，你應該逃離，他絕不屬於你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你無數次告訴自己，他是你生命中的過客，錯過他，你能尋得無數更好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你明知如果追上他，你的生命將會如同沙塵中的陸艦一般看不清航向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你甚至不知道自己的決定是對是錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你依然對著自己的至親吼道——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"“唯有他知道，血就是血！”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"原來，是這種感覺......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你瞭解這種感覺，小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"能天使，我們再來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我先喝口水——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，空進入這種狀態後，你就別想跑啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去幫你們買飲料，順便再帶點吃的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"文先生，你也要——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，人呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g2_srcalley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"報案人","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"終於來了，警察小姐，這裡！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是警察，我是沃爾西尼的城邦法官，您可以稱呼我為拉維妮婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，敘拉古沒有警察。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"報案人","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有警察？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是外國人吧？在這裡，他們會負責街面上的治安。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"報案人","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"他們？我只是來敘拉古談生意的，還不太瞭解這裡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，那些家族成員。您最好別和他們扯上關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"報案人","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"案發現場在哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"報案人","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"您......您自己看，那裡，垃圾桶後面。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"五個人，死亡時間不會超過一天，看打扮是家族的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"報案人","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"拉維妮婭法官，怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......今天早上，我見過他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們早些時候襲擊了一位公務人員，我和他們打了個照面，讓他們跑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，為什麼會在這裡......而且那個領頭的不在其中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"報案人","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我確實聽說敘拉古是個危險的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，如果是家族之間的衝突，他們一定會把現場處理乾淨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不合規矩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當做什麼都沒有發生過吧，先生，為了您的安全著想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡我會接手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"報案人","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"報案人","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"該死的，我今天就想離開這個鬼地方。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":true,"text":"拉維妮婭小姐，沒想到你會主動找我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德米特里，近期城裡有沒有出現什麼行事很張揚的殺手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":true,"text":"嗯？嗯......現在這個時期，沒有什麼人敢放肆吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......需要我把最近一個月的犯罪報告甩在你臉上嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":true,"text":"可能有些只是小誤會而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才，奧爾維耶托大街的後巷裡發現五具屍體，現場沒有被清理，不像是家族的人幹的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而就在今早，我親眼見到這幾個傢伙襲擊了一位公務人員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":true,"text":"嘿，真有意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不關心你們之間的爭權奪利，但別忘記還有秩序存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":true,"text":"別說是現在這個時候，就算是平時，在沃爾西尼，有貝洛內家族坐鎮，又有你這樣一位紀律嚴明的法官在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":true,"text":"發生這種事等於在向貝洛內家挑釁，不會有人敢這麼去做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":true,"text":"除非——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除非是哥倫比亞人，你想這麼說嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":true,"text":"任何不在乎我們定下的規則的人，都有這麼做的可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......有消息了告訴我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":true,"text":"我似乎並不向你負責，拉維妮婭法官閣下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這也依然“等於在向貝洛內家挑釁”，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":true,"text":"好吧，我會告訴萊昂，或許，他會有這個閒心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......對政府官員的襲擊，突然冒出來的殺手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這兩件事之間，真的有聯繫嗎......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g1_srcstreet"},{"type":"narration","text":"潮濕的空氣撲面而來。\n回法院的路上，最近的一起起案件在拉維妮婭的腦海中盤旋而過。\n她很清楚籠罩在這一切之上的是什麼，但在這裡，人們習以為常，連她自己也一樣。\n法院門口，拉維妮婭看向自己的車，然後，忍不住歎了口氣。\n她的車被潑滿了油漆，在周圍的一眾車輛中，顯得格外扎眼。\n這是一種簡單的惡意。\n曾經的她會為此感到無所適從，但如今，這還不如連綿的細雨更讓她感到頭疼。\n當然，還有洗車的費用。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當心點，法官小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雨看來會下很久，不注意腳下，可是會摔倒的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......謝謝你的提醒。但是，你似乎也沒有帶傘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不喜歡打傘，法官小姐，我喜歡雨落在身上的感覺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，也希望你注意腳下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你為什麼要挑釁她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼你會覺得我在挑釁她？嗯？難道說你以為自己開始理解我了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......當我沒說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我確實在挑釁她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她身上有一股我很熟悉，但很討厭的味道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隨你吧。但是，讓我們打入貝洛內家可是你交給我們去做的事，我現在覺得我們只會被貝洛內家懷疑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要知道的是這座城市裡正在發生什麼，以及貝洛內家把德克薩斯帶回來的目的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們打算怎麼做，從一個底層殺手做起，步步高升，然後成為貝洛內家的金牌打手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少，我猜甘比諾是這麼想的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"效率太低了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們需要一些籌碼，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"甘比諾呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他已經去和那位仲介人邀功了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，你看，在敘拉古，他顯然知道怎麼樣能比你爬得更快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不否認。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在龍門生活了這麼久，沒想到敘拉古還是這麼一成不變，我已經完全不適應了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相信我，你馬上會習慣的，和甘比諾一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為你是個敘拉古人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的打算放任他在敘拉古重新發展？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼不呢？你也可以去做，放心大膽地做，我絕不會干涉你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我真是越來越搞不懂，你到底想幹什麼了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在享受雨季，你不喜歡下雨嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只知道，甘比諾恨透了雨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你搞到了什麼消息？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想知道嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，如果我想知道，我該做些什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你運氣不錯，我正好需要一個司機。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bar_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請進，始作俑者先生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我活著回來了，調酒的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"身手還可以，但是，無論是你，甘比諾，還是你那八年前就去了龍門的朋友，卡彭，你們都還不夠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"狼崽子，不要太把自己當回事了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你和傳聞中一樣，總是分不清自己該堅持什麼，又不該堅持什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最後的西西里人就是這樣失去西西里夫人庇護的，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如今的西西里人，除了守著自己那點可憐的榮耀，還能做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽著，甘比諾，我對你和卡彭回到敘拉古來做什麼沒興趣，我也對你們背後的人究竟是誰不感興趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要的是本事，還有行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我們的行動怎麼樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們不屬於這裡，膽子倒很大，這很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你們幫我做事，我給你們報酬，你們做得越好，報酬就越多，就這麼簡單。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們想見到貝洛內，等我滿意，我會讓你們見到他的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會做得好到讓你後悔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道嗎，我並不討厭西西里人這種骨子裡透出來的狠勁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如今的敘拉古反而缺少這種東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你可以試試，甘比諾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到時候你會知道的，我從不後悔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g5_srcpark"},{"type":"narration","text":"宴會即將開始，早已有人等候在門口。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"歡迎，貝亞托先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高傲的官員","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"你是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"盧比奧。我們在上周的宴會見過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高傲的官員","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"噢，我記起來了，食品安全部部長盧比奧，抱歉，瞧我這記性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高傲的官員","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你也在，看來今天的宴會，美食又少不了了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪裡，不過，今天畢竟有貴客，我也確實下了些功夫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高傲的官員","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"原來如此。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勢利的官員","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"貝亞托，這邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高傲的官員","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"來了。那我就先失陪了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勢利的官員","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"那人是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高傲的官員","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"食品安全部部長盧比奧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勢利的官員","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？那副樣子，居然是一個部長？我還以為只是一個門房，過來的時候根本沒理會他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高傲的官員","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"實際上也沒什麼值得理會的，一個小丑罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勢利的官員","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼說？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高傲的官員","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"他不是家族出身，所以，奮鬥一輩子，也只能爬上食品安全部這種不起眼部門的部長位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高傲的官員","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，他上位後，四處巴結家族成員，結果還真讓他搞出了一些名堂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高傲的官員","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"如今，沃爾西尼大大小小的宴會，都是由他的食品安全部來提供食物的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高傲的官員","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"而他也根本不在乎自己的臉面，經常像那樣站在門口迎接賓客。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勢利的官員","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"原來如此，他這副臉皮，倒是有值得學習的地方。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":true,"text":"盧比奧，恭喜你啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這......何喜之有？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":true,"text":"我可是聽說了，今晚的宴會，那位萊昂圖索少爺會出席。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":true,"text":"貝洛內的大少爺，卡拉奇身邊的大紅人，過去可是從來不會出席這種宴會的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":true,"text":"這是你飛黃騰達的好機會，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呵呵，瓦拉赫先生，看來我前幾天送給您的那批肉排您很滿意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不然的話，也不會特意打電話來和我開這個玩笑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":true,"text":"哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":true,"text":"現在不比以前啦，盧比奧，別看我好像是羅塞蒂家在這個城市的領袖，似乎有那麼點威風可耍，其實要守的規矩可多得很。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":true,"text":"比如說，現在，我得和你這傢伙稱兄道弟啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"承蒙您的關照。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":true,"text":"大家親如一家，也挺好。你幫著我，我幫著你，有什麼事情，桌子上解決。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":true,"text":"我們也不想整天打打殺殺的，都是逼不得已，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是，瓦拉赫先生平日也是辛苦得很。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":true,"text":"運輸部部長是貝洛內的人，平常躲著我走，我也不能把他怎麼樣，嘖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":true,"text":"不過貿易部部長是個聰明人，他倒是我的好朋友。羅塞蒂全力支持他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":true,"text":"今天這場宴會的主人，建設部部長卡拉奇是個叫人捉摸不透的傢伙，雖說貝洛內的崽子跟在他身邊，可他倒是和誰的關係處得都不差。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":true,"text":"盧比奧，食品安全可也是很重要的，希望你是個聰明人啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，當然。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"貴客到了，我就先失陪了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":true,"text":"去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g6_newtown_street"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你很強大，德克薩斯小姐。但不湊巧的是，我並不是一個喜歡動武的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"動武是效率最低的一種手段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，如果你期待著為我完成幾項刺殺任務就能離開敘拉古，那我恐怕要讓你失望了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你只需要告訴我，我該做什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡拉奇，沃爾西尼的建設部部長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他負責了新移動城市地塊的建設，是我們的人，我需要你去保護他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個政府官員？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你想說什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“政府就像是灰廳中那張圓桌的桌布。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每一個家族成員都記得西西里夫人的這句感慨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曾幾何時，我們從來沒有將擺在桌布上的餐具與花瓶放在眼中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但現在，我卻不得不去重視。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哥倫比亞人帶來了一些新東西，其中最讓我感到不安的，不是他們帶回來的技術，而是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們做事的方法與敘拉古完全不同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們知道，敘拉古的官員們無法反抗老牌家族們，所以，他們並不要求那些官員公開順從自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們只需要那些人在某些時候睜一隻眼閉一隻眼，或者行個方便。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我們能怎麼辦？把那些官員處理掉無法解決任何問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去找他們麻煩？他們可沒有蠢到會露出馬腳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使我們在這裡有著不弱的影響力，也沒有辦法對他們做些什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，在龍門生活了幾年的你，應該對這種行事方法也很有感觸吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......甚至懷疑自己回到了龍門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，但在敘拉古，甚至還沒有多少人意識到，哥倫比亞人的方法，可能會掀起多大的波浪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道嗎，德克薩斯小姐，真正理解這套方法的運行邏輯時，我感到的是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"佩服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們的武器是利益和交涉，而不是暴力和械鬥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你也學習了他們的方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"學習？不......德克薩斯小姐，我會比他們做得更好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而卡拉奇就是我的牌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最近城裡突發的針對官員的刺殺，雖然還無法確認背後的人是誰，但是，我需要保證卡拉奇部長的安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他是個有趣的人，不喜歡坐車，喜歡步行，雖然有人暗中保護他，但我不放心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經跟他們通過氣了，你去把他帶到宴會現場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g6_newtown_street"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（目標正經過前面的街道，暗處應該有七名以上的家族成員保護。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（看起來問題不大......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（？！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瞧瞧，我就說會有好事發生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德克薩斯，吃千層酥嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_101_sora","aliases":["空"]}]}
